// Simplified Chinese messages translations.
"%@ %@ is now available — you have %@. Would you like to download it now?" = "%@ %@ 已发布，当前版本为 %@。要立即下载吗？";
"%@ %@ is ready to install — you have %@." = "%@ %@ 已准备好安装，当前版本为 %@。";
"A little stronger than Version 1. The sliders below still fall well short of the current look." = "比版本 1 稍强。下方滑块的调整幅度仍明显弱于当前版本。";
"A new version of %@ is available!" = "%@ 有新版本可用！";
"Adjustment parameters may not match Photoshop exactly." = "调整参数可能与 Photoshop 不完全一致。";
"An image could not be saved. The previous project has not been replaced." = "有图像无法保存。原项目未被替换。";
"An image inside the project is missing or damaged. The current document has not been replaced." = "项目中的图像缺失或损坏。当前文档未被替换。";
"Another app changed this project. You can revert to the version on disk, losing your unsaved changes, or keep what you have." = "另一个应用更改了此项目。你可以恢复为磁盘上的版本（未保存的更改将会丢失），也可以保留当前内容。";
"Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice." = "“烘焙”会将当前蒙版效果合并到关联图层的像素中。“移除关联”会显示这些图层的原始像素。两种操作都可以撤销。";
"Blend mode “%@” isn’t supported and will be applied as Normal." = "不支持混合模式“%@”，将使用“正常”模式。";
"Choose a JPEG, PNG, HEIC, HEIF, TIFF, WebP, or Photoshop (PSD) file." = "请选择 JPEG、PNG、HEIC、HEIF、TIFF、WebP 或 Photoshop（PSD）文件。";
"Click the image to center this range on that color" = "点按图像，将该颜色设为此范围的中心";
"Click the image to narrow this range to exclude that color" = "点按图像，缩小此范围以排除该颜色";
"Click the image to widen this range to include that color" = "点按图像，扩大此范围以包含该颜色";
"Close to the current process, with slightly softer primary and shadow shifts." = "接近当前处理版本，原色和阴影的调整略柔和。";
"Cropped to the canvas so the file fits in memory. Pixels outside the canvas weren't imported." = "为使文件适合可用内存，已按画布范围裁切。未导入画布以外的像素。";
"Current default. The calibration sliders below apply at full strength." = "当前默认版本。下方校准滑块按完整强度应用。";
"Earliest response. Hue, saturation, and shadow tint move about half as far as Version 6." = "最早的处理方式。色相、饱和度和阴影色调的调整幅度约为版本 6 的一半。";
"Editable Photoshop text becomes pixels and can’t be retyped." = "可编辑的 Photoshop 文本已转换为像素，无法再修改文字。";
"Faux bold or faux italic was omitted." = "已忽略仿粗体或仿斜体。";
"Firmer color than Version 2. Primary shifts stay gentler than the current process." = "色彩比版本 2 更鲜明。原色的调整幅度仍比当前处理版本柔和。";
"Folder blend mode “%@” isn’t supported. The folder will be pass-through." = "不支持图层组混合模式“%@”。图层组将使用“穿透”模式。";
"Full justification was imported as left alignment." = "两端对齐已转换为左对齐。";
"Image export supports canvases up to %@ megapixels and %@ pixels per side." = "导出图像支持最高 %@ 百万像素的画布，且每边不超过 %@ 像素。";
"Layer effects were discarded, so the appearance may differ." = "图层效果已舍弃，显示效果可能有所不同。";
"No content remained after trimming." = "修边后没有剩余内容。";
"No foreground subject was detected in this layer. Try an image with a more distinct subject." = "此图层中未检测到前景主体。请尝试主体更鲜明的图像。";
"Not enough unselected, opaque image pixels to synthesize a fill. Use a smaller selection with some surrounding image." = "选区外的不透明像素不足，无法合成填充内容。请缩小选区，并保留一些周围图像。";
"Nothing is selected, so there’s nowhere to paint. Choose Select › Deselect (⌘D) to paint anywhere." = "当前选区为空，无法绘制。请选择“选择 › 取消选择”（⌘D），即可在任意位置绘制。";
"Object Selection requires macOS 14 or later." = "对象选择需要 macOS 14 或更高版本。";
"Only 8-bit RGB and CMYK Photoshop files can be imported." = "只能导入 8 位 RGB 和 CMYK Photoshop 文件。";
"Only the first text style was kept." = "仅保留了第一种文本样式。";
"Option-click where Clone Stamp should copy from first." = "请先按住 Option 点按图像，为仿制图章设置取样源。";
"Save changes to %@?" = "要保存对 %@ 的更改吗？";
"Several layers are selected. Select just one to paint on it." = "当前选中了多个图层。请选择一个图层后再绘制。";
"Smudge and Liquify work on a layer's pixels, not its mask." = "涂抹和液化只能用于图层像素，不能用于蒙版。";
"Some dropped items couldn’t be read. Drag JPEG, PNG, HEIC, HEIF, TIFF, WebP, or Photoshop (PSD) files from Finder." = "部分拖入的项目无法读取。请从访达拖入 JPEG、PNG、HEIC、HEIF、TIFF、WebP 或 Photoshop（PSD）文件。";
"That profile isn’t a CMYK output profile." = "此配置文件不是 CMYK 输出配置文件。";
"That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous." = "此选区过于复杂，无法生成轮廓。请调整容差，或开启“连续”。";
"That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %@ megapixels." = "此形状过大。形状最多可覆盖 %@ 百万像素。";
"That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %@-megapixel limit." = "此文本框超出了单边 %@ 像素或总计 %@ 百万像素的限制。";
"The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6." = "2012 年的处理方式。校准强度已接近版本 6。";
"The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete." = "无法读取 Photoshop 文件，文件可能已损坏或不完整。";
"The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted." = "形状图层不支持此 Photoshop 描边，已将其忽略。";
"The Photoshop text warp was omitted." = "已忽略 Photoshop 文本变形。";
"The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas." = "无法渲染画布。请尝试缩小画布。";
"The copied layers exceed this project’s %@-megapixel limit." = "复制的图层超出了此项目 %@ 百万像素的总量限制。";
"The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font." = "未安装字体“%@”，因此使用系统字体显示文本。";
"The image could not be encoded." = "无法编码图像。";
"The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable." = "无法读取图像，文件可能已损坏或无法访问。";
"The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped." = "无法将图层蒙版转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。";
"The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint." = "图层蒙版已停用。请按住 Shift 点按其缩略图以启用，然后再绘制。";
"The object mask could not be rendered." = "无法渲染对象蒙版。";
"The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited." = "智能对象已栅格化。无法编辑链接的内容。";
"The trimmed image dimensions are invalid." = "修边后的图像尺寸无效。";
"There isn’t enough memory to make that selection." = "内存不足，无法创建此选区。";
"This Photoshop file uses a format version Compositor can’t read." = "此 Photoshop 文件使用了 Compositor 无法读取的格式版本。";
"This Photoshop file uses a layer compression method that isn’t supported." = "此 Photoshop 文件使用了不受支持的图层压缩方式。";
"This Photoshop layer type isn’t supported and was imported as pixels." = "不支持此 Photoshop 图层类型，已将其导入为像素。";
"This adjustment type isn’t supported and was skipped." = "不支持此调整类型，已跳过。";
"This clipping mask’s base isn’t supported, so clipping was skipped." = "不支持此剪贴蒙版的基底图层，已跳过剪贴效果。";
"This import exceeds the current %@-megapixel document budget or %@-pixel side limit." = "此次导入超出了当前文档 %@ 百万像素的总量限制，或单边 %@ 像素的长度限制。";
"This is not a valid Compositor project, or its metadata is damaged." = "这不是有效的 Compositor 项目，或其元数据已损坏。";
"This project exceeds the supported canvas, layer, file-size, or %@-megapixel document limit." = "此项目超出了支持的画布、图层、文件大小限制，或文档 %@ 百万像素的总量限制。";
"This project uses format version %@. This app supports versions %@–%@." = "此项目使用格式版本 %@。本应用支持版本 %@–%@。";
"Vector shape was rasterized to pixels." = "矢量形状已栅格化为像素。";
"Your changes will be lost if you don’t save them." = "如果不保存，所做的更改将会丢失。";
"“%@” is a folder, which has no pixels of its own. Paint on a layer inside it, or on the folder’s mask." = "“%@”是图层组，本身没有像素。请在组内的图层或组蒙版上绘制。";
"“%@” is an adjustment layer, with no pixels to paint. Paint on its mask instead." = "“%@”是调整图层，没有可绘制的像素。请在其蒙版上绘制。";
"“%@” is hidden, or inside a hidden folder. Show it to paint on it." = "“%@”已隐藏，或位于隐藏的图层组内。请先将其显示，再进行绘制。";
"“%@” was changed on disk." = "磁盘上的“%@”已被更改。";
